WEBVTT


00:01:32.347 --> 00:01:37.615
What The Hell! I didn't tell you to
go! God Damn! What's wrong with you?


00:01:38.319 --> 00:01:41.287
Aw Man!... Ain't nobody listenin' to me?


00:01:42.288 --> 00:01:47.288
Ladies! You can visit here at any time for free.
I need to see your license and registration.


00:01:47.554 --> 00:01:49.816
Brother, you okay? You cool?


00:01:56.863 --> 00:01:59.457
10 minutes, doors open on my signal.


00:01:59.666 --> 00:02:03.165
I'm glad you're here, Lee! I always
feel better with you watching my back


00:02:03.837 --> 00:02:06.533
I'm just doing my job, Mr. Ambassador


00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:11.899
Stay close to me today
Lee, we're making history.


00:02:13.247 --> 00:02:15.716
This is bullshit! You know who I am?


00:02:15.717 --> 00:02:16.984
My family owns half of Rodeo drive!


00:02:17.584 --> 00:02:20.688
Do you know who I am?
Detective James Carter. L.A.P.D.


00:02:21.288 --> 00:02:22.790
My family owns half of Crenshaw Blvd.


00:02:22.791 --> 00:02:23.958
I want a lawyer


00:02:23.959 --> 00:02:27.786
You need a personal trainer, it's like you're a
180 Ibs. you weigh more then the damn car, girl.


00:02:27.787 --> 00:02:28.787
I have a Tyroid condition,


00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.165
What's that mean Tyroid's?


00:02:30.365 --> 00:02:34.493
Look... can't you just like
give us a warning or something?


00:02:34.528 --> 00:02:40.030
That depends... you girls like Chinese?


00:02:40.065 --> 00:02:41.640
Excuse me.


00:02:42.044 --> 00:02:43.068
Carter?


00:02:43.069 --> 00:02:46.069
Lee, we're on for tonight, I just
picked up 2 girls, who wanna play hot...


00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:47.070
with an Asian Policeman


00:02:47.383 --> 00:02:50.518
I can't talk now, I'm in
the car with Ambassador Han.


00:02:50.618 --> 00:02:52.788
Trust me. These girls are
sushi great, we gotta hit these!


00:02:52.789 --> 00:02:54.054
I have to go, I'm sorry.


00:02:54.089 --> 00:02:55.657
You're still mad at me aren't you?


00:02:55.658 --> 00:02:57.860
You're mad because of what
happened when we was in New York.


00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:59.027
I don't want to talk about that.


00:02:59.028 --> 00:03:01.196
That was 3 years ago,
when you gonna let it go?


00:03:01.197 --> 00:03:03.632
Let it go? Isabelle was my girlfriend.


00:03:03.633 --> 00:03:06.100
Lee, we're friends man, just come
over here one night, the Wushu's on me.


00:03:08.003 --> 00:03:10.267
Lee?


00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:14.534
My mom says hi.


00:03:40.036 --> 00:03:43.740
The Chinese Triads now
has a 1/2 million members,


00:03:43.741 --> 00:03:45.580
In over one 100 countrys, and...


00:03:45.587 --> 00:03:49.850
...these are not street kids,
shaking down local merchants.


00:03:49.951 --> 00:03:55.810
These are buisness men, who build a $50 billion
empire on extortion, drugs, sex and slavery.


00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:02.014
We must cut off the head... of this
snake, before it swallows us whole.


00:04:02.126 --> 00:04:06.823
As Chairman of the World Criminal Court, I
have intrusted my good friend, Ambassador Han...


00:04:07.231 --> 00:04:10.860
to lead the Fight, against the largest
criminal organization in the world.


00:04:25.616 --> 00:04:28.847
Ladies and Gentlemen.


00:04:29.848 --> 00:04:32.948
The Triads society is build on secrecy


00:04:34.392 --> 00:04:38.563
Nobody knows who these men are
who control them, who leads them.


00:04:38.598 --> 00:04:41.264
Nobody has known for 500 years.


00:04:41.299 --> 00:04:44.462
But today I stand before
you with a secret of my own.


00:04:44.503 --> 00:04:49.372
Today I will disclose information
that effects everyone in this room.


00:04:49.575 --> 00:04:51.275
After years of searching,


00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:53.643
I believe I finally
located the Sha Xing.


00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:57.350
Mr. Ambassador, Sha Xing is not exist.


00:04:57.385 --> 00:05:00.151
Excuse me, who is this Sha Xing?


00:05:00.186 --> 00:05:02.620
With all due respect, Sir. I like...


00:05:11.298 --> 00:05:13.901
Everybody down!


00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.480
- Call an ambulance!
- Someone get a doctor!


00:05:16.481 --> 00:05:19.440
- Ambassador down!
- The Ambassador is down!


00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:21.080
Stay with him!


00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.100
Na... ah, ah, I'm keeping
these, 'till I see you tonight,


00:05:55.120 --> 00:06:00.200
World authority, World Criminal Court
Bldg. The Chinese Ambassador has been shot!


00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.960
Chinese Ambassador? - Move
your ass girl, move over! - Shit


00:06:41.579 --> 00:06:44.579
Lee!


00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:50.580
What the Hell is he doin'?


00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:57.100
- L.A.P.D. get out of my way!
- Give us a brake.


00:06:58.539 --> 00:07:01.438
Hey Lee, I'll get you when I come back,


00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.460
Lee, I'm coming!


00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:41.180
Don't move!


00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:46.740
Hello, Lee.


00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:56.945
Put your hands up, Kenji!


00:07:56.980 --> 00:08:00.620
Lee, what're you waiting for? Shoot me.


00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:08.020
Maybe this will help.


00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.500
Drop the gun or I'll shoot!


00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:20.060
I think we both know,
that's not gonna happen.


00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:25.780
Kenji!


00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:28.625
You see?


00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.380
I know you too well.


00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.620
Lee, you okay?


00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:53.020
Lee, I all-most killed your
ass, why didn't you move?


00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:57.180
I like you to meet our dates for
this evening, Marsha and Dora.


00:08:57.181 --> 00:08:59.181
The Fat one's yours!


00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.440
How many times you want
me to say it, I'm sorry...


00:09:07.441 --> 00:09:09.280
I'm sorry I ran you over, man, damn.


00:09:09.281 --> 00:09:10.420
Not now all right... not now


00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.440
All right, hold it right there.


00:09:12.441 --> 00:09:13.480
Don't say a word Carter.


00:09:13.481 --> 00:09:15.440
Capt. O'Neal, I had
nothing to do with this.


00:09:15.441 --> 00:09:17.280
All I did was borrow a
car and backed up Lee.


00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:18.600
Tell him partner.


00:09:18.601 --> 00:09:20.360
I need to see Ambassador Han.


00:09:20.361 --> 00:09:22.280
The Ambassador is just out of surgery.


00:09:22.281 --> 00:09:24.560
The bullet missed his
heart. He's gonna be okay.


00:09:24.561 --> 00:09:26.960
Capt'n, you have to give me back
my shield and put me on this case.


00:09:26.961 --> 00:09:29.080
I made one little mistake,
take a brother of the bench.


00:09:29.081 --> 00:09:31.480
One little mistake? You handcuffed
2 woman, and stole their car.


00:09:31.481 --> 00:09:34.800
Isn't that why we have insurance?
Anyone has an off day Capt'n.


00:09:34.801 --> 00:09:37.501
Last month you arrested 6 Iranians
and put them in jail for a week.


00:09:37.502 --> 00:09:40.160
You and I both know them
Iranians was terrorist.


00:09:40.161 --> 00:09:42.320
They were scientist at UCLA.


00:09:42.321 --> 00:09:44.600
Big deal... 'cause they
cure cancer in rats...


00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:46.520
that doesn't mean
they dont blow shit up!


00:09:46.521 --> 00:09:48.240
Sir, let me find the person
who shot Ambassador Han.


00:09:48.241 --> 00:09:51.080
Relax Carter, the L.A.P.D. will
be heading this investigation.


00:09:51.081 --> 00:09:53.240
The Ambassador is my responsibility.


00:09:53.241 --> 00:09:56.080
Then maybe you can tell me
exactly how the shooter got away.


00:09:57.160 --> 00:10:01.520
Also... the Ambassador's daughter is
coming here to see her father right now.


00:10:01.521 --> 00:10:02.521
Make sure nothing happends to her!


00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:05.480
Don't worry, Capt'n,
we gonna make you proud.


00:10:05.481 --> 00:10:07.440
And try not to think about
your wife leaving you.


00:10:07.441 --> 00:10:09.120
She'll come back.


00:10:09.121 --> 00:10:11.680
Soo Yung's here? I haven't seen
her since she was 10 years old.


00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.880
She lives here in Los Angelos now.


00:10:13.881 --> 00:10:14.881
Let's go to the gift shop and
get her a little teddy bear,


00:10:16.969 --> 00:10:18.938
In a bra...


00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:22.400
Lee, I'm so glad you're here.


00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.540
Detective Carter.


00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:28.820
- It's been so long.
- So long... Soo Yung, so long.


00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:32.660
- How is he?
- He is out of surgery.


00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.500
They said he will be okay.


00:10:37.501 --> 00:10:39.220
Soo Yung, I'm sorry.


00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:43.540
It was my fault. I didn't
get to him fast enough.


00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:49.900
I want you both... to
promise me something.


00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:53.500
I want you to find the
man who did this to him.


00:10:53.501 --> 00:10:54.700
I want you to find him because...


00:10:54.701 --> 00:10:57.500
I don't think he'll stop
untill my father is dead.


00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:59.100
Soo Yung.


00:10:59.101 --> 00:11:00.620
I need to hear you say it.


00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:04.420
Okay, I promise.


00:11:04.421 --> 00:11:05.940
And so do I.


00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.740
Thank you.


00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:14.300
Soo Yung, your father was addressing
the court before he was shot.


00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:18.300
2 weeks ago, my father
mailed me an envelope...


00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:21.900
he said, if anything ever happend
to him, I should give it to you


00:11:21.901 --> 00:11:22.860
Where is it?


00:11:22.861 --> 00:11:24.100
I put it in my locker...


00:11:24.101 --> 00:11:26.420
at the Kung Fu studio, where I teach,


00:11:26.421 --> 00:11:31.260
It's at 8347 First Street... China Town.


00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.420
Go home, Carter, this has
nothing to do with you,


00:11:45.421 --> 00:11:47.940
I made Soo Yung a
promise the same as you.


00:11:47.941 --> 00:11:50.140
This is a business of China,


00:11:50.141 --> 00:11:52.060
Well for your information
I'm part Chinese now,


00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.700
That's right Lee, for the last 3 year,
I studied at the Institute of the Budah...


00:11:55.701 --> 00:11:58.701
Earning 2 black belts
in Wushu Martial arts


00:11:58.702 --> 00:11:59.702
And spending every afternoon at
the Hong Kong Massage Parlor...


00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:02.540
I'm half Chinese, baby!


00:12:02.541 --> 00:12:04.620
If you're half Chinese,
I'm half black...


00:12:04.621 --> 00:12:07.780
I'm your brother, and I'm fly,
you're done with this, Snoopy?


00:12:07.781 --> 00:12:09.020
That's dope, ain'it?


00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:11.100
Sorry Lee, you can't be black!


00:12:11.101 --> 00:12:13.260
There's a height requirement. I'm
still with you, no matter what,


00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:14.460
Go home, Carter!


00:12:14.461 --> 00:12:17.820
I can't leave you, Lee,
now you're my "Peng You"


00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:19.540
I can't leave my brother!


00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:40.580
All right, listen up!


00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.585
I need everyone's attention!


00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:45.680
I'm Detective Carter,
this is Inspector Lee


00:12:45.715 --> 00:12:48.705
We need see Soo Yung's locker right now!


00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.460
No one is allowed in the back,
without the master's permission,


00:12:51.495 --> 00:12:54.580
Maybe you didn't hear me,
we need to see that locker


00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:56.440
I'm sorry


00:12:56.475 --> 00:12:57.740
Wait, Carter!


00:12:57.780 --> 00:12:59.300
Lee, I got this!


00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:01.780
Hey!


00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:05.185
Kids listen, Knife's will solve nothing,


00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:08.340
As the Chinese say, all great
battles are won without fighting,


00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:09.680
Sorry!
- Ok?


00:13:09.715 --> 00:13:10.900
I don't know him!


00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:18.460
Look!


00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:21.020
Let's try again from the top!


00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.625
None of the Wushu formality,


00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.620
You ain't gonna see it coming...
you ain't gonna see it coming!


00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.500
Stop!


00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.700
Run for your lives!


00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:34.180
It's about time, I get some
respect around here!


00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:38.700
Carter, wait for the master!


00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:43.760
Whoa, damn!


00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:48.520
Sorry, man, I thought
this was the bathroom, sorry!


00:13:49.521 --> 00:13:51.760
Lee, I got a big problem, man!


00:13:51.761 --> 00:13:53.761
This boy's on steroid's,
he's got a head like King Kong.


00:13:53.762 --> 00:13:54.960
Oh no!


00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.200
Carter? You're okay?


00:14:00.235 --> 00:14:01.360
Lee, Lee...


00:14:08.235 --> 00:14:10.360
Awww... my bunion.


00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.360
Come on, man, let me go,
I love Chinese people.


00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:23.600
Wait!


00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.740
How you say surrender in Chinese?


00:14:39.441 --> 00:14:45.741
Okay, I'm gonna slice you up
like a Giant California Roll


00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:16.940
I'm sorry!


00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.160
May I help you?


00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:38.280
We'll be asking you questions, old man


00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:39.080
Who are you?


00:15:39.115 --> 00:15:39.645
Yu!


00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.600
Not me, you!


00:15:40.635 --> 00:15:41.485
Yes, I'm Yu


00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.240
Just answer the damn
question, who are you?


00:15:43.275 --> 00:15:44.445
I've told you!


00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:46.720
Are you deaf?
- No, Yu is blind,


00:15:46.755 --> 00:15:47.977
I'm not blind, you're blind,


00:15:48.012 --> 00:15:49.165
That's what I just say,


00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.440
You just say what?
- I did not say what, I say Yu,


00:15:51.475 --> 00:15:52.605
That why I ask you,


00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:54.560
And you're not answering...
- Shut up!


00:15:54.595 --> 00:15:55.605
You!
- Yes?


00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.360
Not you, him! What's your name?


00:15:57.395 --> 00:15:58.525
Mi
- Yes, you!


00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.200
I am Mi
- He's Mi! And I'm Yu


00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.700
And I'm gonna whoop your ass
old man, sick of playing this game...


00:16:03.735 --> 00:16:06.980
you, me, and everybodys
ass around here, you...


00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:09.545
Carter!


00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:11.380
- Lee, no, no,
- Carter,


00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:16.860
Teacher, My name is Inspector Lee.
We have a key to Soo Yung's locker,


00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:21.500
Some men came here this morning,
they had guns. They emptied...


00:16:21.535 --> 00:16:23.820
her locker, I could not stop them,


00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:25.140
You must go to her at once,


00:16:25.175 --> 00:16:25.785
Why?


00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:29.940
They said, she would end up
like her father.


00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:32.020
Let's go! Thank you.


00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:36.100
I don't know what the hell you feeding him, but he's too damn big.
- Carter, let's go!


00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:58.980
Where's everyone?


00:16:59.015 --> 00:17:00.500
Where's all the damn cops?


00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:06.785
Lee?


00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:07.585
Where's the security?


00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:09.020
