from the chapel upstair...


00:19:58.495 --> 00:20:00.940
she speaks fluent French, and she's
pleased to intrubite for you,


00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.940
Sister, we appreciate
you're doing this


00:20:02.975 --> 00:20:03.905
My Pleasure!


00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:06.780
Sister Agnes, please ask who send him!


00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:14.945
