00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:18.020
That one day, you'll beg him
for mercy, he also said...


00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:19.940
What?


00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:22.620
Please, Sister, we have to know!


00:20:22.655 --> 00:20:23.280
There's lifes at stake.


00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.460
Well, he used the "N" word


00:20:25.495 --> 00:20:27.180
What, the "N" word?


00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:29.580
- You tell this little mother...
- Carter!


00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:32.220
She's a nun,


00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:37.660
Sister, you tell this piece of "S" word,
that I will personally "F" word him up!


00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.145
Did he say Nigger?


00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:51.460
He use the "N" word again, but this
time he mention your grandmother


00:20:51.495 --> 00:20:53.900
You tell him, that his mama is a "H",


00:20:53.935 --> 00:20:55.185
Carter!


00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:56.985
I believe Whore is spelled with a "W"


00:20:57.020 --> 00:21:01.100
Right, "W", and his sister's a "W",
and his grandmama is 2 big "W's"...


00:21:01.135 --> 00:21:03.177
who makes 2 double that's got no "T's"!


00:21:03.212 --> 00:21:05.220
You tell I'm said that!


00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:17.365
Did he say it again?


00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:23.400
No, this time, he called this Gentleman
